## Issues Breakdown {#issues-breakdown}

### By Severity {#by-severity}

```
🔴 CRITICAL (6 issues)
├─ Rate limiter fails open in production
├─ No middleware for API route protection
├─ Refresh token cookie path mismatch
├─ No logout revocation
├─ TOTP form UI logic unclear
└─ Audit log signature confusion

🟠 HIGH (4 issues)
├─ In-memory rate limiter memory leak
├─ No correlation IDs for tracing
├─ TOTP migration path incomplete
└─ No password expiration policy

🟡 MEDIUM (3 issues)
├─ Timing attack on email enumeration
├─ No CORS configuration
└─ No rate limiting on password change

✅ RESOLVED BY DESIGN
└─ All other aspects are solid
```

### By Category {#by-category}

**Authentication/Security (4 issues)**

- Rate limiter failing open ❌
- Logout revocation missing ❌
- TOTP migration weak ❌
- Email timing attack ⚠️

**API/Middleware (2 issues)**

- No middleware gate ❌
- No CORS config ⚠️

**Infrastructure (2 issues)**

- Cookie path mismatch ❌
- No request tracing ⚠️

**Business Logic (1 issue)**

- No password expiration ⚠️

