## Fix Priority & Timeline {#fix-priority-timeline}

### Phase 1: Critical Blockers (Must fix before ANY deployment) {#phase-1-critical-blockers-must-fix-before-any-deployment}

**Timeline:** 4\-6 hours\
**Scope:** 6 fixes

1. ✅ Rate limiter fail\-closed (30 min)
2. ✅ Add middleware (45 min)
3. ✅ Fix cookie path (15 min)
4. ✅ Logout revocation (30 min)
5. ✅ Verify TOTP UI (45 min)
6. ✅ Audit log checks (15 min)

**Validation:** Full auth flow test, rate limit tests, session revocation tests

**Exit criteria:**

- All unit tests pass
- Manual testing checklist complete
- No security linter warnings
- Ready for staging

### Phase 2: High\-Priority (Before scaling to 15k DAU) {#phase-2-high-priority-before-scaling-to-15k-dau}

**Timeline:** 8\-10 hours\
**Scope:** 4 fixes

1. ✅ Memory leak fix (30 min)
2. ✅ Request correlation IDs (1 hour)
3. ✅ TOTP migration robustness (1.5 hours)
4. ✅ Password expiration (2 hours)

**Testing:** Integration tests, load testing

### Phase 3: Medium\-Priority (Within 2 weeks) {#phase-3-medium-priority-within-2-weeks}

**Timeline:** 6\-8 hours\
**Scope:** 3 fixes \+ 2 enhancements

1. ✅ Timing attack mitigation (30 min)
2. ✅ CORS middleware (45 min)
3. ✅ Password change rate limiting (30 min)
4. ✅ API documentation (2 hours)
5. ✅ E2E test suite (3 hours)

