## Impact Analysis {#impact-analysis}

### Current State (Pre\-Fix) {#current-state-pre-fix}

**Security Risk:** 🔴 **HIGH**

- Brute\-force attacks possible (rate limiter fails on serverless)
- Session hijacking possible (no logout revocation)
- Privilege escalation possible (no API middleware)

**Operational Risk:** 🔴 **HIGH**

- Out\-of\-memory crashes (rate limiter leak)
- Unable to debug issues (no request tracing)
- Compliance violations (no audit trail integrity)

**User Experience:** 🟡 **MEDIUM**

- Admin login might fail intermittently (cookie path)
- 2FA flow unclear (form UI)

### Post\-Fix State {#post-fix-state}

**Security Risk:** 🟢 **LOW**

- All critical attacks prevented
- Proper session management
- Comprehensive audit logging

**Operational Risk:** 🟢 **LOW**

- No memory leaks
- Observable request flow
- Audit trail integrity

**User Experience:** 🟢 **GOOD**

- Smooth auth flow
- Clear error messages
- Proper session handling

* * *

## Success Metrics {#success-metrics}

### Phase 1 Completion Criteria {#phase-1-completion-criteria}

```
Authentication Flow
  ✅ Login with email + password
  ✅ 5 failed attempts → locked
  ✅ Logout → refresh token revoked
  ✅ Old refresh token rejected
  ✅ 2FA flow works end-to-end

Rate Limiting
  ✅ 10 IP attempts in 15 min → blocked
  ✅ 5 email attempts → locked
  ✅ Redis down → requests rejected (not allowed)

API Security
  ✅ Unauthenticated API requests rejected
  ✅ Audit logs written for all actions
  ✅ All security headers present

Quality
  ✅ All unit tests pass
  ✅ No linting warnings
  ✅ No security scan findings
  ✅ Code coverage > 80%
```

