## Recommendation {#recommendation}

### Go/No\-Go Decision {#gono-go-decision}

**Current Status:** ❌ **NO\-GO for Production**

**Conditions for Go:**

1. ✅ All Phase 1 critical fixes implemented & tested
2. ✅ No open security linter warnings
3. ✅ All unit tests passing (\>80% coverage)
4. ✅ Staging deployment successful
5. ✅ Manual security checklist completed
6. ✅ 2\+ code reviewers approved

**Target Production Date:** Sep 15, 2026 (after Phase 1 \+ staging validation)

**Fallback:** If Phase 1 takes longer, deploy Phase 2 in parallel; Phase 3 can wait 2 weeks

